@startuml
title Submit expense and calculate allocation
actor Member
participant ExpenseUseCase
participant Authorization
participant AllocationPolicy
database Store
Member -> ExpenseUseCase: submit fields
ExpenseUseCase -> Authorization: current payer and participants?
Authorization --> ExpenseUseCase: allow / deny
ExpenseUseCase -> AllocationPolicy: validate and allocate exact minor units
AllocationPolicy --> ExpenseUseCase: shares sum to total
ExpenseUseCase -> Store: save PENDING + shares + policy version + notice intents
Store --> ExpenseUseCase: committed ID
ExpenseUseCase --> Member: pending result (no balance change)
@enduml
